  "id": "organismic-valuing-process",
  "term": "organismic valuing process",
  "definition": "The organismic valuing process is a humanistic psychology idea that views personal growth as a holistic, ongoing process. It treats well-being as something that develops by integrating different aspects of a person’s experience over the lifespan.",
